<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef firm on very light demand.  Select and Choice rib, chuck, round and loin cuts firm with many cuts not well tested.  Beef trimmings not established.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>88 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
